---

<PostLayout meta={meta}>
<p>This project was part of a design assignment given to me when I was applying to <a href="https://crib.in/">Crib</a>.</p><div><figure><Image src={cover} alt="" /></figure><figure><Image src={img5} alt="" /></figure><figure><Image src={img6} alt="" /></figure><figure><Image src={img7} alt="" /></figure></div><div><figure><Image src={img9} alt="" /></figure><figure><Image src={img10} alt="" /></figure><figure><Image src={img8} alt="" /></figure></div><p>Based on the above existing designs and the basics of layouts, I drew the following wireframes for the layout</p><div><Image src={img1} alt="A wireframe with a persistent sidebar and a large hero section." /> <Image src={img2} alt="A wireframe with no navigation." /> <Image src={img3} alt="A wireframe with a sidebar for categories, similar to a modern McDonald's self-serve." /></div>
</PostLayout>
